Citation_Text:
Measurements of water quality parameter (pH, Temperature, Conductivity, Biocide residual) must occur at least 3 times each week while the cooling tower system is operating. 
At the time of inspection, operational records provided by on-site representative and reviewed by Department failed to demonstrate proof that the following water control parameter(s) listed were measured and recorded during active cooling tower operation: 
PH Values incomplete for: 07/12/2023-08/17/2023; 
Temperature Values Incomplete for: 07/12/2023-08/17/2023; 
Conductivity Values Incomplete for: 07/12/2023-08/17/2023; 
Biocide Monitoring Values Incomplete for: 07/12/2023-08/17/2023.
